  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diocese of Maralal - Vehicle support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Catholic Diocese of Maralal covers  the entire Samburu District&apos;s administrative boundaries. Samburu District is ranked among the poorest districts in Kenya. It is affected by unpredictable climatic conditions that results in prolonged droughts.Contributing to the rising levels of poverty are the inter-ethnic cattle raids and conflicts related to access to natural resources such as land and pasture. 
The Diocese has four development programmes; pastoral, human promotion, human health and justice and peace that mainly rely on one off funding and individual donations made to the Diocese. 

The project aims to work on improving food security among pastoralist communities in Samburu district through improving access to water for livestock and domestic use, through enhancing livestock production and marketing and mainstreaming HIV/AIDS and gender.</narrative>
  </description>
